    "title": "pandas.StringDtype.storage — pandas 3.1.0.dev0 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.StringDtype.storage#\n\n- property StringDtype.storage[source]#\n- The storage backend for this dtype. Can be either “pyarrow” or “python”. See also \n  - `StringDtype.na_value`\n  - The missing value for this dtype.\n Examples >>> ser = pd.Series([\"a\", \"b\"]) >>> ser.dtype <StringDtype(na_value=nan)> >>> ser.dtype.storage 'pyarrow'",
